// VERBATIM COPY. Do not edit by hand.
//
// Source: revme-ai/src/constants/categories.ts
// Check:  node scripts/check-categories.mjs   (fails when the two diverge)
//
// Marketplace categories are not a database column. The tenant app derives a
// business's category at query time by scoring these keyword lists against its
// sector and keywords, so the console has to run the identical derivation or it
// will report a category the customer's own page does not show.
//
// This is a copy rather than a shared package because the two repos deploy
// independently. The drift check is what makes a copy safe: without it, a
// category added on one side would silently disagree with the other.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

